# What the build context must not carry. Two kinds of thing live here: directories that are
# regenerated inside the image, and host-local state that would actively corrupt it -- a Linux
# node_modules built for another libc, or a stale dist/ the console stage would rather build
# itself.

# Version control and tooling
.git
.github
.gitignore
.editorconfig
.skills

# Local-only scaffold (gitignored, kept on disk -- see docs/decisions/0001-repository-layout.md)
github setup

# Regenerated in the image
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.pyc

# Secrets and datasets: the image reads its configuration from the environment at run time
**/.env
.env
*.csv
